  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing CariCloud**\n\nOkay, I\'m starting with a skill check to assess my capabilities for building this **CariCloud** system for Marikina eateries. I need to determine if I have the right tools to tackle this specialized web-based POS project. The `cloudsql-execute-sql` skill is now being evaluated in the context of the requirements.\n\n\n**Evaluating Skillset Depth**\n\nI\'m now assessing my skills relative to the project, going beyond initial checks. I\'ve considered `cloudsql-setup` and `cloudsql-update-schema`, and how those fit in with the project\'s needs. `Firebase-integration` is also being reviewed in case it could be useful. I\'m taking a deep dive into `focus-mode` and considering how to manage my time and effort in the right spots. I am also reviewing API integration techniques.\n\n\n**Defining Backend Infrastructure**\n\nI\'m now outlining the backend infrastructure. I\'m thinking of building API routes in Express for menu, orders, debts, end-of-day reports, BPLO, PayMongo QR integration, tax relief, and subscription handling. I\'ll need a client-side manager using IndexedDB or local storage, complete with online/offline sync status.\n\n**Defining User Management**\n\nI\'m now considering account configuration. I\'m contrasting single operator mode and multi-tenant mode, weighing admin governance against a cashier POS view with user profiles. I\'m also planning to implement PIN logins and role-based permissions.\n\n**Specifying Module Needs**\n\nI\'m deep in module specifications, especially the menu management piece. I\'m focusing on a daily rotating menu grid by dish type with modifiers and portion scaling. The plan includes a \"Sold Out\" badge feature for real-time order blocking. I\'m now transitioning to the order and transaction module, thinking about high speed scenarios!\n\n\n**Designing Order Processing**\n\nI\'m now deep in order processing. I\'m focusing on a 3-tap quick-key system for order entry: category/item, then portion/modifier, then tender and pay. I\'m designing statutory discount processing with a one-click senior/PWD toggle, and am also planning for multi-modal payments: cash, e-wallet via PayMongo integration, and a \"Listahan\" ledger for debts.\n\nI\'m starting to build out a module for analytics, compliance, and debt monitoring. The end-of-day financial reconciliation will include cash box count input, unsold dish logging (for food waste calculation), and net profit calculation. I\'ll need a real-time debt/credit ledger for balances, repayments, and credit limit tracking. I\'m also planning a local tax relief eligibility tracker for Marikina businesses.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 647759417
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
