  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing App Integration**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building `/src/App.tsx`. My current thought process centers around the core interactions it needs to manage. Specifically, I\'m working through loading state from the client\'s storage database, which includes menu items with real-time toggles and customer data. I\'m also considering the implications of custom dish additions and edits within the menu structure, which will then seamlessly integrate with the customer data.\n\n\n**Defining App Persistence**\n\nI\'m now thinking about data persistence across various app states. I\'m focusing on key data: recent transactions, store settings including operational modes and SaaS tier, end-of-day logs, debt repayment logs, and tax relief stats. I need to figure out the best way to manage online/offline network detection using `navigator.onLine` to trigger data sync. Also, I\'m analyzing active user profiles in Single Operator Mode and Multi-Tenant Mode.\n\n\n"
