  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Requirement Compliance**\n\nI\'m now meticulously cross-referencing every detail of CariCloud\'s definition with the user\'s explicit requirements. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the generic web-based POS system design, and the target domain for local cafes, particularly Carinderia operations in Mar. The goal is to establish complete adherence to the specification.\n\n\n**Defining Design Elements**\n\nI\'ve been solidifying the design principles, prioritizing high-speed efficiency with a clean, modern aesthetic. The focus is on intuitive navigation and large, legible typography, leveraging a warm orange/amber palette and soft cream surfaces. I\'m integrating Express and Vite for a full-stack architecture, utilizing IndexedDB and LocalStorage for local data management. I am moving towards a robust offline sync indicator. I\'m focusing on defining the architectural components, and how to structure account configuration and menu management effectively.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the development of **CariCloud**, a generic Web-Based Point-of-Sale System tailored for Marikina City cafeteria and carinderia operations.\n\n### Key Architectural & Feature Highlights:\n\n- **Visual Identity & Design System**:\n  - **Warm Accent Palette**: Designed with vibrant Marikina Warm Orange (`#E65100` to `#FF6D00`) and Terracotta Amber accents over clean Off-White/Soft Cream surfaces.\n  - **High-Speed Touch UI**: Formatted with high-visibility, large-type touch targets designed for fast 3-tap checkout during peak lunch rush hours.\n\n- **Core Architecture & Offline Sync**:\n  - **Full-Stack & Client Storage Engine**: Express REST API backend integrated with IndexedDB client-side database management (`db.ts`) for continuous offline operation during internet outages.\n  - **Sync Status Indicator**: Real-time top bar status badge (`Online (Synced)` vs `Offline Mode - Pending IndexedDB records`) with background synchronization.\n\n- **Account Configuration & Multi-Tenancy**:\n  - **Single Operator Mode**: Combines Admin and Staff workflows into a single workspace for solo owners.\n  - **Multi-Tenant Mode**: Activates role separation between Administrator governance and Cashier Staff workspaces with Manager PIN security (`1234`).\n\n- **Menu & Stock Synchronization**:\n  - **Daily Menu Digitization**: Categorized dish grid (*Ulam*, *Rice*, *Drinks*, *Snacks*, *Specials*).\n  - **Portion Scaling Switch**: Line-item toggle that divides base prices into half-orders (e.g., \342\202\26170 Pork Adobo \342\206\222 \342\202\26135 Half Portion).\n  - **Real-Time Sold Out Badges**: Toggle switches to block ordering of depleted dishes instantly.\n\n- **High-Speed Transaction & Multi-Modal Settlement**:\n  - **Statutory Discount Processing**: 1-click Senior Citizen / PWD calculation applying 20% discount and 12% VAT exemption with mandatory SC/PWD ID logging.\n  - **Multi-Modal Payment Settlement**:\n    - **Cash**: Rapid tender presets (Exact, \342\202\26150, \342\202\261100, \342\202\261200, \342\202\261500, \342\202\2611000) with real-time Change calculation.\n    - **E-Wallet (PayMongo API)**: Generates dynamic **QR Ph** codes with GCash/Maya compatibility and simulated asynchronous webhook verification.\n    - **Listahan Credit (Utang)**: Verifies customer credit limits; requires Manager PIN override (`1234`) if limits are exceeded.\n\n- **Analytics, Compliance & Debt Monitoring**:\n  - **End-of-Day (EOD) Reconciliation**: Cash box audit interface, unsold food wastage logger, and net profit calculator.\n  - **Digital Customer Credit Ledger (\"Listahan\")**: Digital utang directory replacing paper notebooks with payment recording.\n  - **Marikina Tax Relief Eligibility Tracker**: Monitors annual gross sales towards Marikina\'s \342\202\261250,000 SME tax relief threshold with status indicators and tax savings estimates.\n  - **Automated BPLO Reporting**: Generates downloadable/printable Sworn BPLO Sales Tax Declarations matching Marikina City Hall layouts.\n\n- **Tiered SaaS Subscription Model**:\n  - **Tier 1 (\342\202\26149/mo)**: Core POS Counter, Listahan Ledger, SC/PWD Discounts, EOD Audit.\n  - **Tier 2 (\342\202\26199/mo)**: Internal UI Personalization (Themes: Warm Orange, Terracotta Amber, Emerald, Slate).\n  - **Tier 3 (\342\202\261199/mo)**: Marikina \342\202\261250k Tax Relief Tracker & Automated BPLO Form Generator."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 249800414
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
