    modified_response: "I have completed all the requested features and enhancements for the system:\n\n- **Login Landing Page (Owner vs. Employee)**:\n  - Created a dedicated **Login Landing Screen** where users select between **Store Owner (Administrator)** and **Cashier / Employee Staff**.\n  - **Security Validation**: Logging in as Store Owner requires entering the Security PIN (default `1234`), providing full system access. Employee login grants immediate cashier workspace access.\n\n- **Role-Based Menu & Management Process**:\n  - **Owner Controls**: Only Store Owners (`ADMIN`) can add new menu items, edit prices/descriptions, delete dishes, or toggle sold-out statuses.\n  - **Employee Mode**: Employees have read-only access to the menu configuration with clear role indicators and focus purely on taking customer orders, processing carts, and managing active sales.\n\n- **Receipts Archive Section**:\n  - Added a dedicated **Receipts Archive Module** accessible to both Owners and Employees.\n  - Displays archived receipt records, transaction breakdowns, payment methods (Cash, PayMongo QR Ph, Listahan Credit), timestamps, cashier names, and senior/PWD discount logs with search and filtering capabilities.\n\n- **Fast Order Flow (Skip Print Option)**:\n  - After completing any transaction, receipts are automatically stored in the system archive.\n  - Cashiers can immediately click **\"Start New Order (Skip Print)\"** to reset the POS counter without needing to print paper receipts, or choose **\"Print & New Order\"** when required."
