    modified_response: "I have completed all the requested updates for **CariCloud POS**:\n\n- **Login & Role Selection Landing Page (`LoginLandingPage.tsx`)**:\n  - Implemented an initial portal where users choose between logging in as a **Store Owner (Ate Maria - Admin)** or **Employee Staff (Cashier)**.\n  - Secured with PIN verification (Default: `1234` for Owner, `0000` for Cashier) along with quick demo login options.\n\n- **Role-Based Menu Management (`MenuManagementModule.tsx`)**:\n  - Enforced strict permissions: **Only Store Owners** can add new dishes, edit prices/half-portion rates, delete items, or toggle real-time stock/sold-out statuses.\n  - Employee cashiers are provided a read-only menu view with an explanatory banner.\n\n- **Dedicated Receipts Archive (`ReceiptsArchiveModule.tsx`)**:\n  - Created a **Receipts Archive** tab in the main navigation accessible by both Store Owners and Employees.\n  - Allows searching by receipt number, cashier name, customer name, or payment method, with options to inspect and reprint past transaction records.\n\n- **Flexible Post-Transaction Checkout (`ReceiptModal.tsx`)**:\n  - Automatic receipt archival upon order settlement.\n  - Updated post-checkout options with a prominent **\"Start New Order (Skip Print)\"** action, allowing cashiers to begin taking the next customer\'s order immediately without printing physical thermal paper."
