    items {
      text: "The landing page should be account based. Meaning to say, as an owner, I have to login to my account to get in, same as the employees. This prevents security breaches. Also the Subscription or the \"Plans (SaaS)\" should only be able to show on the Owner\'s end, as the owner is the one who will be subscribing into the subscription. Also, if the owner chooses the Multi-Tenant Mode in the Settings, they should be able to add employees to their system.\n\nNow, when the owner edits the Menu, they should also be able to add an image that displays the item."
    }
