3a641?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'m4\',\n    name: \'Special Pinakbet\',\n    category: \'Ulam\',\n    price: 50,\n    halfPrice: 25,\n    isSoldOut: false,\n    allowHalfOrder: true,\n    description: \'Saut\303\251ed native vegetables with bagnet bits and bagoong.\',\n    image: \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540420773420-3366772f4999?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'m5\',\n    name: \'Special Dinuguan\',\n    category: \'Ulam\',\n    price: 70,\n    halfPrice: 35,\n    isSoldOut: false,\n    allowHalfOrder: true,\n    description: \'Rich pork blood stew seasoned with green chili and vinegar.\',\n    image: \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574484284002-952d92456975?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'m6\',\n    name: \'Beef Kare-Kare\',\n    category: \'Ulam\',\n    price: 90,\n    halfPrice: 45,\n    isSoldOut: false,\n    allowHalfOrder: true,\n    description: \'Rich peanut sauce stew with tender beef, eggplant, and string beans.\',\n    image: \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585032226651-759b368d7246?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'m7\',\n    name: \'Pork Menudo\',\n    category: \'Ulam\',\n    price: 75,\n    halfPrice: 38,\n    isSoldOut: false,\n    allowHalfOrder: true,\n    description: \'Pork stew with liver, potatoes, carrots, and hotdog slices in tomato sauce.\',\n    image: \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563379091339-03b21ab4a4f8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'m8\',\n    name: \'Lumpiang Shanghai (4 pcs)\',\n    category: \'Ulam\',\n    price: 40,\n    halfPrice: 20,\n    isSoldOut: false,\n    allowHalfOrder: true,\n    description: \'Crispy fried pork spring rolls with sweet chili sauce.\',\n    image: \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541696432-82c6da8ce7bf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'m9\',\n    name: \'Plain Rice\',\n    category: \'Rice\',\n    price: 15,\n    isSoldOut: 