    modified_response: "I have completed all the requested features and updates for **CariCloud POS**:\n\n- **Account-Based Security & Login Portal**:\n  - Implemented an account selection login screen (`LoginLandingPage.tsx`) where users choose their specific Store Owner or Employee Cashier account.\n  - Required entering the account\'s 4-digit security PIN to unlock the corresponding workspace (`ADMIN` vs. `CASHIER`).\n\n- **Owner-Restricted SaaS Subscription Tab**:\n  - Filtered the **Plans (SaaS)** tab in `Header.tsx` so that it is visible exclusively to Store Owners (`ADMIN`).\n  - Added access guards to preventing employee accounts from attempting tier upgrades.\n\n- **Multi-Tenant Employee Account Management**:\n  - Added an **Employee Staff Account Governance** section in `SettingsModule.tsx` when **Multi-Tenant Mode** is active.\n  - Owners can create new employee cashier accounts (name, custom 4-digit PIN, avatar), edit staff details, or delete staff accounts.\n\n- **Menu Display Images & Uploads**:\n  - Enhanced `MenuManagementModule.tsx` with photo display support.\n  - Owners can set dish display photos by uploading local image files, pasting an image URL, or selecting from quick Filipino dish preset photos (Adobo, Sinigang, Pinakbet, Kare-Kare, etc.).\n  - Dish photos are rendered on both the Menu Management cards and the POS counter interface."
