  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Login Implementation**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the linting and compiling stages for both `lint_applet` and `compile_applet` completed without errors. I\'ve now turned my focus to the implementation of the account-based login. The landing page is updated and now fully features the authentication form. Username/Email and password fields are included, plus auto-fill buttons for quick testing.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have updated the application to support account-based authentication and restricted access to the Listahan (Utang) credit ledger:\n\n- **Account-Based Login System**:\n  - **Username / Email & Password**: Replaced simple PIN selection with account-based sign-in requiring a registered username/email and password.\n  - **Pre-Configured Accounts for Testing**: Included quick auto-fill buttons for demo accounts:\n    - **Store Owner**: `owner@caricloud.ph` (Username: `atemaria`, Password: `password123`)\n    - **Shift Cashier**: `cashier@caricloud.ph` (Username: `juana`, Password: `password123`)\n- **Forgot Password Flow**:\n  - **3-Step Email Recovery**: Added a \"Forgot Password?\" workflow where users enter their email/username, receive a simulated 6-digit verification code sent to their email address, and set a new password. Reset passwords update in local storage and auto-fill into the login form.\n- **Listahan (Utang) Owner Restriction**:\n  - **Header & Navigation Guard**: Marked the Listahan (Utang) tab with an **Owner Only** badge for staff accounts and blocked navigation attempts by cashiers.\n  - **Module Access Control**: Added a security policy screen inside `ListahanModule` that displays an **Access Restricted: Store Owner Only** alert whenever a staff account attempts to view customer debt balances or credit records."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 657472891
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
