  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Login Landing Page**\n\nI\'m now building the `LoginLandingPage.tsx` component. The initial state will be `selectedPortal` which can be `null`, `\'ADMIN\'`, or `\'CASHIER\'`. For the landing screen when nothing is selected, I\'m thinking a heading like \"Select Your Login Portal\" will work.\n\n\n**Refining Login Flow**\n\nI\'ve decided on two cards for portal selection: \"Login as Owner\" and \"Login as Employee\". Clicking either sets `selectedPortal`. The next phase includes the \"OWNER LOGIN\" or \"EMPLOYEE LOGIN\" header, username/password fields, and \"Forgot Password?\". Role validation is also being added during submit, ensuring correct account type.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
