    modified_response: "I have completed all requested updates for role-based access control and credit ledger enhancements:\n\n- **Employee Settings Simplification**: Updated the Settings view for Employee accounts to display only **Internal UI Personalization** (theme and font scaling), hiding store information, staff management, and tax configuration.\n- **Tab Access Restrictions**: Restricted the **Marikina Tax Relief** and **EOD Audit** navigation tabs strictly to **Owner (Admin)** accounts.\n- **Employee Cash Payment Recording**: Enabled employees to record cash repayments directly from the digital customer credit ledger (**Listahan**).\n- **Credit Payment History Section**: Added a dedicated credit payment history section within the **Listahan** tab, featuring per-customer account filters, collected payment totals, cashier audit trails, and individual customer history inspection modals."
